e clutter and focus on sharing. LinkShorter keeps the\n              essentials fast, focused, and easy to use.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"mt-12 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3\">\n            {features.map((feature) => {\n              const Icon = feature.icon;\n              return (\n                <article\n                  key={feature.title}\n                  className=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-background p-6\"\n                >\n                  <div className=\"flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary\">\n                    <Icon className=\"size-5\" />\n                  </div>\n                  <h3 className=\"mt-5 text-lg font-semibold\">\n                    {feature.title}\n                  </h3>\n                  <p className=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">\n                    {feature.description}\n                  </p>\n                </article>\n              );\n            })}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section className=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-7xl flex-col items-start justify-between gap-8 px-6 py-20 sm:flex-row sm:items-center lg:px-10\">\n        <div>\n          <p className=\"text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary\">\n            Ready when you are\n          </p>\n          <h2 className=\"mt-3 max-w-xl text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl\">\n            Start sharing links people remember.\n          </h2>\n        </div>\n        <Show when=\"signed-out\">\n          <SignUpButton mode=\"modal\" forceRedirectUrl=\"/dashboard\">\n            <Button size=\"lg\" className=\"h-12 rounded-full px-6\">\n              Create your free account\n              <ArrowRight className=\"size-4\" />\n            </Button>\n          </SignUpButton>\n        </Show>\n      </section>\n\n      <footer className=\"border-t border-border\">\n        <div className=\"mx-auto